  "contract": {
    "seed": "One in-memory synthetic Ed25519 capability key creates four original service proofs. A privileged controlled fixture declares a synthetic grant and a PREPARED/FENCED/BOUND funding record, not authenticated funding. The V6 checkpoint is stored atomically with the original declared funding pair. A four-entry runner completes two responses, loses the third response after the local backend commit, persists quarantine, and never attempts its tail.",
    "bridge": "The reviewed unsaved controller waits for actual seed exit zero and complete streams, rereads the stock command receipt and CAS output, validates the one-case TAP plan and diagnostic, observes the process group absent, matches both full SQLite files and physical identities to the seed witness, and rechecks source/preservation/environment/Git before starting recovery. Public proofs and the checkpoint/pins are copied exactly from that bounded private witness.",
    "recovery": "A distinct normally exiting Node process opens the same two files. It generates no key, proof, funding pair, transport, session, unit execution or deadline callback. The actual backend original-outcome reader accepts the exact three original requests/public proofs with the original checkpoint pins. Cached successes remain nested DATA under CLIENT_RECONCILIATION_REQUIRED; intent, response and UNKNOWN distinctions remain.",
    "byteContinuity": "The exact serialized checkpoint, independent pins, original request JSON/public proof vector, full backend rows/schema and non-owner-epoch payer rows/schema remain equal. The backend file's complete bytes remain equal. Opening the existing payer store increments only its declared owner_epoch from two to three; its complete file hash is expected to differ.",
    "identityContinuity": "Both database files retain their device/inode/owner/group/mode/link-count identities; final bytes and complete before-open bytes were independently pinned.",
    "originalBytes": "The bounded synthetic funding request body is empty; the complete payment payload and PAYMENT-REQUIRED header are retained, not a selected requirement alone. Opaque context includes preserved spacing and a trailing newline. No unknown real original bytes are reconstructed.",
    "authorization": "All checkpoint and recovery views remain powerless DATA, authority NONE, delivery NOT_ESTABLISHED, and real payment signer DISABLED. Trusted declared fixture pins are not authenticated production pin custody.",
    "uncertainty": "Three originals and dispatch intents, two strict local response observations, one persistent UNKNOWN quarantine and an unattempted tail remain. Neither cached success nor ordinary native close clears uncertainty or grants dispatch/payment authority.",
    "notAuthentication": "Local SQLite checksums, full-file hashes and the witness do not establish authenticated database integrity, pin authenticity, anti-rollback, secure key custody, real chain funding, provider READY or actual service delivery."
  },
